{"decision":"edit","issues":[{"quote":"crossing in front of the dark central cloud mass","problem":"The airplane travels across the lower sky beneath the main dark cloud mass rather than visibly crossing in front of it."},{"quote":"before fading from view","problem":"No gradual fading is visible; the airplane disappears by moving out of the right edge of the view."},{"quote":"The open sky is left empty once more","problem":"The sky remains filled with clouds and sunset light after the airplane leaves; only the airplane is gone."}],"caption":"The video captures a sunset over a calm sea. The low sun rests just above the horizon, throwing a bright golden column of reflection across the rippling water. A silhouetted coastline with a path and trees curves along the left, while a heavy band of purple and orange cloud fills most of the sky. The camera holds essentially still as the cloud edges slowly reshape and the dark central mass shifts subtly against the coastline.

A small airplane silhouette enters at the left edge of the sky, just above the horizon line. It travels steadily from left to right at roughly constant altitude, crossing the lower sky beneath the dark central cloud mass. Then it passes through the bright glare surrounding the sun and continues toward the right side of the scene before moving out of view at the far right edge.

The sky is left without the airplane once more as the sun remains low, its golden reflection shimmering as ripples change while the clouds keep their slow drift.","length_note":""}
